title Login and token refresh
browser[Browser] -> auth[Auth Server] : POST /login
auth -> users[Users DB] : verify password
users --> auth : OK
auth --> browser : access + refresh token
wait 1
browser -> api[API Server] : GET /me (expired token)
api -x browser : 401
browser -> auth : POST /refresh
auth --> browser : new access token
browser -> api : GET /me
api --> browser : 200
